  "source": "Use only policy 7cf5 own public observation and historical joint search-selected order vs unchanged full Master3s2. Wins, draws and losses all participate. No other agent or mixture; physically disjoint estimate by map. Held previous development, not virgin evaluation.",
  "advantage": "Y=clip(official margin/3000,-2.5,2.5)+0.5*sign(margin). Old V from complete frozen trunk/economic scalar head on preaction own observed history. Debias Y-V by training-only stage (<100/<200/else) mean offset, leave physical map out within fit to avoid self-label baseline. A=clip(Y-V-offset,-1,1), weight exp(1.2A), globally mean-normalized per role after equal-game/equal-root weighting; never assign a fabricated negative target to untried actions.",
  "policy": "Frozen original 96-channel trunk. Two 96-to-action affine deltas and biases, standardized on training hidden rows per role. Smooth bounded modification 1.25*tanh(linear/1.25); same zero, BC, AW. Loss recorded-action NLL plus 0.25 KL(parent||candidate) + .003/2 coefficient L2. Fit worker and eligible base separately. Same objective/weights apart from advantage. Exclude hard go-home workers and bases ineligible after preceding historical base order. Keep raw BC and bounded AW control. Trained weights deployed on OWN _act root only before home and before _search receives shared lw/lb.",
  "validation": "On four held maps: equal game/role advantage-weighted NLL below both BC and zero, and below BC at least 3/4 map means. Compute advantage-contrast of held weighted log-prob, all-game unweighted NLL and MAP statistics by seat and phase. Only pass if stable nonzero physically attributable native source-issued change with same candidate count, per-candidate depths, root enemy response and public snapshot in at least 2 held maps, and finite weights/output. Confidence and strength require subsequent independent real H2H.",
  "physical": "16 fixed root tickets from the held matches (t46,165 per seat); same random seed from source identity, 0.58, native original model/parent distinct from teacher-free outcome. ABCA baseline-first or reversed by row (zero,BC,AW,zero or zero,AW,BC,zero); stable parent control and matched counts/depths on all arms required for attribution, keep every ticket.",
  "constraints": "No new game, no formal maps or submissions. 10/4 effective train/hold terrains."
